		"accessible": true,
		"exclusive_to_week": "",
	},
	{
		"id": 65,
		"name": "Lunar Rift Manifestation",
		"category": Category.GEOLOGICAL,
		"severity": 1,
		"danger": 1,
		"scale": 3,
		"type": Category.ANOMALOUS,
		"description": "A Lunar Rift Manifestation is a type of unknown Geological occurrence in which an area of land previously not home to a Lunar Rift comes to suddenly possess one. How this happens is unknown, but what is known is that the process always results in the successful creation of a Lunar Rift. There are no known occurrences of a Lunar Rift Manifestation that has failed.\n \n Lunar Rift is a designation contained solely within the Lunar Geologic Bureau, and as such, does not exist within the M.A.R.S anomaly database. L.R.Ms pose no danger. ",
