		"unlocked_on_day": 3,
		"accessible": true,
		"exclusive_to_week": "",
	},
	{
		"id": 66,
		"name": "Researcher Complaint",
		"category": Category.SCIENTIFIC,
		"severity": 1,
		"danger": 1,
		"scale": 3,
		"type": Category.GENERAL,
		"description": "Unlike your typical Complaint, Researcher Complaints must be from a Researcher or anyone with a similar title, and MUST be about the following; Budget, Rules, Standards and Practices, Ethics, Other Researchers, Responsibilities, Time Off (as in, the length of their time off, and not complaints about the time off itself), and Resources. If their complaint contains anything else  then the already stated, please file as either a Complaint (#16) or a Urgent Notice (#95) \n \n If you believe the cause of the complaint is due to another anomaly, please attempt to diagnose as that anomaly instead.",
