		"category": Category.INDUSTRIAL,
		"severity": 1,
		"danger": 1,
		"scale": 1,
		"type": Category.SECURITY,
		"description": "Cargo Sabotage is a variant of Cargo Accident that solely revolves around the human component of the accident. Due to the strict laws around the safety and stability of cargo transportation, any human failure regarding the transportation process is treated as a major crime, specifically sabotage. Most individuals, however, are not aware of this, and will typically report human caused Cargo Accidents as Cargo Accidents and not Cargo Sabotage. \n \n If you believe that a Cargo Accident as some form of human involvement, please file as a Cargo Sabotage instead.",
