		"accessible": true,
		"exclusive_to_week": "",
	},
	{
		"id": 87,
		"name": "Unauthorized Gathering",
		"category": Category.SECURITY,
		"severity": 1,
		"danger": 1,
		"scale": 2,
		"type": Category.SECURITY,
		"description": "An Unauthorized Gathering is a type of security violation that commonly occurs with major Residential stations such as Apollo, Central, and Northern Stations. U.Gs typically fall into many categories, but for the sake of database brevity, they have all been merged into this entry. In order for a gathering to be authorized, the administrator for the gathering must require a permit from their local Lunar Authority office, or from the Station Administrator. \n \n The following gatherings, when without a permit, are unauthorized; Raves, Block Party, Protest, Ride-Outs, Planned Gatherings of Unknown Nature of more than 40 people, Any gathering that is violent in nature, Concerts, and Flash Mobs. \n \n Most calls regarding U.Gs will be from either an individual that is a part of the U.G or a part of the local Security Force. If you believe that the U.G in question is authorized, but is still be shut down by Security forces, please file as a Security Overreach (#94)",
		"icon_path": "",
		"unlocked_on_day": 3,
		"accessible": true,
		"exclusive_to_week": "",
	},
	{
		"id": 88,
		"name": "Rogue Ice Survey Drone",
		"category": Category.SCIENTIFIC,
		"severity": 3,
		"danger": 4,
		"scale": 2,
		"type": Category.GEOLOGICAL,
		"description": "Rogue Ice Survey Drones are scientific drones meant for drilling ice cores around the northern and southern poles that have either gone off their programming or have been purposely reprogrammed in order to change their programming. Either way, these drones can cause incredible harm to those around them, primarily through use of their ice drill, though burns from their thrusters, gravity manipulators, and sheer impact from speed, have been reported. \n \n Due to the circumstances in which a Ice Survey drone can become rouge, callers will typically report previous instances of strange behavior from the drone, or suspicious behavior from technically inclined individuals around them, as well as injuries from the drone itself.",
		"icon_path": "",
		"unlocked_on_day": 4,
